    "updated_at": "2019-04-30T12:37:59Z",
    "body": "For Firefox it does match the threat model. We don't follow the quoted should however. Instead we tell the user which bits of information will be shared with the site and then let the user decide whether they are okay with that. Determining what is visible (and even more so, visible to the user) is nigh-on impossible.",
